{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1000_p", "source_sha256": "71f220cc37e61fc8845af6af0073dc2b199056d40969bb57b14cd1e2f70af5d8", "ja": "（普段の仕事に『≡君彩≡』の活動が加わって、\n恵美のスケジュールがいつにも増して忙しい）", "zh": "（在平时的工作之外又加上了“≡君彩≡”的活动，惠美的日程比平时更加繁忙。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c4620e6e0ef72647cf923ef9983eb0ae290d4bd6e3bdf2a3b6e3f5f6d8ddaefe", "ja": "（本人が楽しそうなのは幸いだけど、無理しないよう\n気を配らないとな。ええと、今週の予定は……）", "zh": "（好在她本人看起来很开心，但也得留意别让她太勉强自己。呃，我看看这周的安排……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "d3a0a53a51adf0ce537266b5acbe98140387868e888c780c75d2e2253b86aadc", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}。あのさ、\n金曜のミーティングってずらせたりする？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。那个，周五的会议能不能改个时间？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6c038b9fbf5a5ebcfbc1d433079dbc227783d1459bcf16cef207782cd9540f98", "ja": "おお、恵美、お疲れ。早速……金曜というと、\n夕方からのだな。うん、調整できると思うよ。", "zh": "哦，惠美，辛苦了。说起来……你说星期五，是指傍晚开始的那个吧。嗯，我想应该可以调整。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "9b86bb49dad67ecea09d96b3a4df00b0ce809563096546d3b70b94c528b168ed", "ja": "ホント？　ありがと、助かる～！", "zh": "真的？谢谢你，帮大忙了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ff000703bc47373a49f05933964caca068f65025f480707c2cc2fd6a31ab182d", "ja": "最近忙しいし、休む時間も必要だよな。\n少しはゆっくりできそうか？", "zh": "最近挺忙的，也需要休息一下。\n能稍微放松一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "0c38948b065bcbc9239af7d7d303deead78c135c28b757e3e915570e8d9f7720", "ja": "へ？　あ、違う違う！　『もこもこパンチ』のコたちの\nライブに誘われてさ。せっかくだから行きたいなって。", "zh": "诶？啊，不对不对！是被邀请去看『蓬松拳』的孩子们的演唱会了。难得有这个机会，我就想着还是想去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c1666355cd53ebd3bd40742e4dfda746760193361220028c171a4381b2958579", "ja": "もこもこパンチ？", "zh": "毛绒绒拳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "1f14ae779bafe607d4964897ec8ec3e0749a5355c57279cd05c7db00922ab393", "ja": "{$P$}も、覚えてるでしょ？\n前に『≡君彩≡』がライブやった時にいたコたち！", "zh": "{$P$}也还记得吧？\n之前“≡君彩≡”开演唱会的时候在场的那些女孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "67f3f11e7808fb5672db75850ee817691c322383ec9c792ee39f7533650a73d7", "ja": "『庭園』のラストライブの時も、\n色々手伝ってくれたじゃん。", "zh": "『庭园』的最终演出时，她们也帮了不少忙嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8bf763bb1e9f82446779bf14d522bc49dc12f2b15b948e4e7922046724d4044b", "ja": "ああ、対バン相手だったあの子達か。", "zh": "啊，是那群曾经和我们对台演出的孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f35e63e0181cd2689ae79d53a5b35b6af5ad0b77b3e200488b4b6688b62a67c7", "ja": "（あの時は、アイドルのバンドなんてと陰口を\n叩かれて、亜利沙が凹んでしまったんだったな）", "zh": "（那时候，她们被人在背后嘀咕“偶像组成的乐队什么的”，结果亚利沙都消沉了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0fafc15d5f704310d98365c85f01646b6b90be106e1896018bbbdc99d2c25b91", "ja": "というか、いつのまにそんなに仲良くなったんだ？", "zh": "话说回来，你们什么时候变得这么要好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "826b15196143761c37ddc554d6ea1082dd0bb9312f0fce0ea62b3921589e4fa2", "ja": "いつだ？　てか、こないだ\nばったり会ったんだよねー。", "zh": "什么时候？话说，前阵子我们偶然碰到了来着——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "23f3a917cfc990926afdf0aab49898658a13f721bfba17dea373ca3215c34cb4", "ja": "再集結したって言ったら驚いてたけど。\nそれでまた、やりとりするようになったんだけどさ。", "zh": "我说重新聚到一起后，她还吓了一跳呢。\n然后，我们又开始联系了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1015_p", "source_sha256": "be0f356627897494d6a3c3743873ef871854791709a49e55b26bfcc41d930791", "ja": "そうか、連絡先は交換してたんだったな……。", "zh": "这样啊，原来你们交换过联系方式啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "daaf58cf38843cd6ed47a9482488defb21f9cdf58377a19a8369182fbc0f20d0", "ja": "うん！　そしたら、ライブあるんだけどって。\nせっかくだし、可奈と亜利沙と3人で行こうかなって。", "zh": "嗯！然后就说，正好有场演唱会什么的。  \n难得有机会，就想着要不要和可奈、亚利沙还有3个人一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "00eb3f5a5e74cd25bd20e7c2b478e63f08b340d523c62575470898cba9328b6f", "ja": "そだ、都合つくんならさ、{$P$}も\nいっしょに行かない？　あ、仕事とか抜きで！", "zh": "对了，要是你有空的话，{$P$}也一起来吗？　啊，跟工作没关系哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd5ce67defe318e8802edb7fc26aa5c0b65927cd6997033b0931ed21ab2a7da3", "ja": "え？　えーと……そうだな。ミーティングの予定を\n変えるから、空けられるかも？", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……怎么说呢。要改一下会议安排，说不定能抽出时间来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "f4ce6e05f17eda39e54fc1adc0dc9b17d60da4abdf39c40d5db23da229bae3c6", "ja": "やった！　んじゃ、「ひとり追加でお願い」……っと。\nにゃはは、楽しみ～♪", "zh": "太好了！那就说“再加一个人，拜托了”……好了。\n呀哈哈，好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "48657187a19164b6d32134ee5940ee09658474c696501d0f06eb7244779a86c5", "ja": "友達も増えるし、バンドって\nいいコトばっかだね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "朋友也会增加，组乐队真是好处多多呢，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0663_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d7024c414872cd6ddee6b7b8d77ca639d1b282e040415c40fb64e0b9950327aa", "ja": "（相変わらず、すごいコミュ力だ……。\n友達が増える事そのものを楽しめる、恵美らしいな！）", "zh": "（社交能力还是一如既往地强啊……。享受交到更多朋友这件事本身，真是很有惠美的风格！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
